==Quests==
;Attunement
Though attunement is no longer required, the quest chain still remains in-game and can be completed if desired. The player title of [[Champion of the Naaru]] was awarded to those who completed the original attunement quests for this raid and [[Eye (Tempest Keep)|The Eye of Tempest Keep]], but is no longer available. The quest outline is as follows:

#Enter the [[Slave Pens]] in Heroic Mode.
#Find {{NPC|icon=Naga Male|Neutral|Skar'this the Heretic}} captive in a cage before the second boss and complete [[The Mark of Vashj (quest)]].
#Complete his quest [[The Cudgel of Kar'desh]].
#*Retrieve the [[Earthen Signet]] from {{NPC|icon=Gronn|Boss|Gruul the Dragonkiller}} in the [[Gruul's Lair]] raid.
#*Retrieve the [[Blazing Signet]] from {{NPC|icon=Nightbane|Boss|Nightbane (boss)||Nightbane}} in the [[Karazhan (raid)|Karazhan]]
#Return to Skar'this and he will cast [[The Mark of Vashj]] on you which allows the wearer to enter Serpentshrine Cavern.

;Battle for Hyjal attunement
*[[The Vials of Eternity]]

;Black Temple Attunement
The following quest starts the [[Black Temple attunement]] quest chain. It requires the completion of [[Akama's Promise]].
*[[The Secret Compromised]]

